+/* ClassicVoices patch (Eva): the same MLPG, statement for statement, on flat per-frame arrays [T][3][D]
+ * (static, delta, delta-delta) instead of ZbGauss pointers - Eva has one Gaussian per FRAME, and ZbGauss frames
